      "message": "test(xtask): gate maps name the owning crate for moved post suites\n\nThe Gate map headers of grblhal_post and tinyg_post named app::post, a\nmodule that moved to camcraft_post, which no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app\nrejects. Name camcraft_post::post and camcraft_post::machine instead; the\nsuites still import camcraft_app and stay in crates/app/tests.\n\nFixes #1331\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
